Z||000004||grinthock||08-20-2001||04:41 PM||||Wow, wish I could get a couple more responses on this one.....  Went out tonight to find 2 problems.. first, A CRACKED EXHAUST MANIFOLD!! DAMMIT!! On the front!  GEEZ!  At least it's the easy one to replace.  Also, the EGR Solonoid has a rubber hose on it, mine seems to have been cut... Ideas?||||reg||1
Z||000005||afRaceR||08-20-2001||04:53 PM||||I had been having a similar problem, doesn't sound quite as extreme as your case.<BR>But I had an extreme loss of power, engine stumble, adjusting timing didn't help at all, and no codes.<BR>I was driving one day and the car cut out completely, no electrical at all.  The battery terminal had broke completely through.<BR>Replaced connector and it runs better than it ever has.<BR> just an idea.||||reg||1
